    <!--
        Said plainly, without alarm: this is a local network service, which is
        the ordinary way these things work, and the honest thing is to say what
        it does and does not protect.
    -->
    <string name="lan_notice">Syncing runs over your local network and is not encrypted. Anyone else on the same Wi-Fi could see which tracks are copied. Pair on a network you trust.</string>

